      "id": "claim_d50fc54c225c4eb1b72446198aeea849",
      "statement": "compactSDPStr splits the SDP on CRLF, trims each line, and for each line performs exactly one of: drop it, rewrite it, run a dictionary substitution (for m=/candidate/fingerprint/c=/extmap/rtcp-fb), or keep it verbatim; surviving lines are joined with the '~' separator.",
