    },
    {
      "id": "claim_05fc2dba30b84da1aca7a547c8100c1f",
      "statement": "Decompact restores the fixed session-scoped lines (v=, s=, t=, a=extmap-allow-mixed, a=msid-semantic:) by pushing them before the per-line loop and re-derives a=group:BUNDLE by unshifting it to the front after the loop; a defined option means the field was dropped (compact) / restored (decompact) while an undefined option means the SDP's own value is preserved.",
